{"title":"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/4/7d49893f110a2741db7ddb1dc5b77fc78d5932bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2x)=\\frac{2}{2+x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"112\" height=\"38\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/e/02e28efa00c4f2c66d1aa381c0cb1f8e0ef8d6e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/4/d4413ac2b0f0624e66a84d57d4984ced1dc45b29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2f(x)=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/1/db193e823bed0176bc7fbcaf1f642c2e3ac96e78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } \\frac{2}{1+x}\\quad \\text{(B) } \\frac{2}{2+x}\\quad \\text{(C) } \\frac{4}{1+x}\\quad \\text{(D) } \\frac{4}{2+x}\\quad \\text{(E) } \\frac{8}{4+x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"445\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/4/7d49893f110a2741db7ddb1dc5b77fc78d5932bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2x)=\\frac{2}{2+x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"112\" height=\"38\" />, we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/4/634936829d1c9f4e13cc0031054fc8015657037f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=\\frac{2}{2+\\frac{x}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"104\" height=\"43\" />. This also means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/6/5c6a708766e38587d3d35a23d50f6bb4821422f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2f(x)=\\frac{4}{2+\\frac{x}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"113\" height=\"43\" /> which simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/e/62effaf0d5dc9bfa1d137bed40c4baa73698962d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />. \n</p><p>~ samrocksnature\n</p><p>~ clarification by Leon\n</p><p>Note: Wait what\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME\" title=\"1993 AHSME\">1993 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1993 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1993\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\